{"seq":1,"slug":"wartime-cryptanalysis","title":"战时的密码破译","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/other-contributions/wartime-cryptanalysis","wordCount":2058,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"战时的密码破译\">战时的密码破译</h1><p>二战期间，图灵在英国政府密码学校（GC&amp;CS）所在的布莱切利园（Bletchley Park）领导对德军&quot;恩尼格玛&quot;（Enigma）密码的破译工作。与他的论文不同，这是一项<strong>工程与组织成就</strong>：图灵设计了用于自动搜索密钥的&quot;炸弹机&quot;（Bombe），并主导破译了德国海军最难的 Enigma 变体。本篇聚焦<strong>技术细节、关键人物、可考时间与数字</strong>；图灵在布莱切利园的生平叙事见 <a href=\"../../life-and-times/the-war-years/bletchley-park\">布莱切利园</a> 与 <a href=\"../../life-and-times/the-war-years/breaking-enigma\">破解恩尼格玛</a>，本篇不重复其传记线索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇的核心论断：<strong>Bombe 不是&quot;试遍所有密钥&quot;的暴力机，而是一台靠逻辑矛盾高速排除错误密钥的搜索装置——它的判据是自洽性，不是正确性。</strong> 理解它要抓住三点。</p>\n<p>其一是<strong>弱点的利用</strong>。Enigma 有两个可乘之隙：任何字母加密后不会变成自己（反射器设计），以及德军报文的格式化（天气报告、&quot;无特殊情况&quot;等固定词组）。前者提供逻辑约束，后者提供&quot;猜词&quot;（crib）这一已知明文片段。其二是<strong>自洽性判据</strong>。把猜词里明文与密文的字母对应连成&quot;菜单&quot;回路；错误的转子设置几乎必然在回路上引出&quot;某字母同时等于两个不同字母&quot;的矛盾而被瞬间淘汰，只有极少数自洽设置会让机器停下待人工验证。其三是<strong>集体工程的定性</strong>。Bombe 是波兰先驱奠基、图灵总体设计、韦尔奇曼对角板改良的接力成果，而非一人之功。</p>\n<p>由此得到一条重要边界：Bombe 是<strong>专用机电装置，不可编程</strong>，与通用计算无关；它证明的是&quot;利用结构弱点把天文搜索压到可执行&quot;，这一思路与图灵日后把模糊判断量化为统计论证的风格一脉相承。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Enigma 弱点&lt;br/&gt;无字母自映射 + 报文格式化&quot;] --&gt; B[选一段猜词 crib]&#10;    B --&gt; C[连成菜单回路]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Bombe 高速试转子位置]&#10;    D --&gt; E{该位置是否自洽?}&#10;    E --&gt;|矛盾| F[瞬间排除]&#10;    E --&gt;|自洽| G[停机&lt;br/&gt;候选密钥交人工验证]&#10;    F --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Enigma 弱点&lt;br/&gt;无字母自映射 + 报文格式化\"] --&gt; B[选一段猜词 crib]\n    B --&gt; C[连成菜单回路]\n    C --&gt; D[Bombe 高速试转子位置]\n    D --&gt; E{该位置是否自洽?}\n    E --&gt;|矛盾| F[瞬间排除]\n    E --&gt;|自洽| G[停机&lt;br/&gt;候选密钥交人工验证]\n    F --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"恩尼格玛的难点在哪里\">恩尼格玛的难点在哪里</h2><p>Enigma 是一台机电转子加密机。它的强度来自每按一个键、转子就转动一格，使同一个字母每次加密成不同密文——即<strong>多表替换</strong>。其密钥空间天文数字般庞大：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><munder><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>选 3 转子并排序</mtext></munder><mo>×</mo><munder><munder><msup><mn>26</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>初始位置</mtext></munder><mo>×</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>26</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>插线板 10 对</mtext></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>20</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\;=\\; \\underbrace{\\binom{5}{3}\\cdot 3!}_{\\text{选 3 转子并排序}} \\times \\underbrace{26^3}_{\\text{初始位置}} \\times \\underbrace{\\frac{26!}{6!\\,\\cdot\\,10!\\,\\cdot\\,2^{10}}}_{\\text{插线板 10 对}} \\;\\approx\\; 1.5\\times10^{20}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.7264em;vertical-align:-2.2764em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.1736em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">选</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> 3 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">转子并排序</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-1.852em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.598em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.2764em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1904em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">初始位置</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\"